umoja-desktop (2026.46.5) stonking; urgency=medium

  * Screen recording records the whole monitor on multi-monitor setups
    (needs Mir 2.28.0-4umoja13). Clicks pushed into the top screen edge
    and corners reach the top bar's buttons (Mir umoja12). Terminal
    cursor hotspot and pointer that vanished after paste fixed (Mir
    umoja11). XDG autostart apps start at login like GNOME, after the
    tray is up so their icons show. Log Out asks for confirmation like
    GNOME. The clock follows the locale's 12/24-hour format unless
    clock-format is set. Sound in Quick Settings follows PulseAudio, with
    output/input device pickers and a microphone slider; power off,
    restart and log out go over D-Bus like GNOME. Compact shell sizing
    and a slicker overview, a restyled layout picker, blur behind every
    see-through shell surface and the Power Off dialog; the greeter shows
    the wallpaper sharp with a frosted login card. Lower memory and CPU
    use across the panel, dock, overview, notifications and lock screen;
    idle local models unload after 10 minutes. Embedded Lemonade updated
    to v2026.45.3. Also: workspace slide keeps windows on their monitor,
    screenshot UI opens faster and remembers the last area, notification
    banners no longer leave a dead click area. The panel no longer
    crashes at logout, and the panel, dock and overlay stop restarting
    in a loop after logout.

