umoja-desktop (0.2.0) stonking; urgency=medium

  * GNOME-style window management: Alt+Tab, overview with workspace
    thumbnails, snap previews, workspace switcher, touchscreen gestures.
  * Notifications that behave like GNOME and look like notify-osd, media
    keys with GNOME OSDs, PolicyKit agent, idle screen blank and lock.
  * Assistant: model download and picker, tool calling through umoja-mcp,
    read-only troubleshooting, optional OpenAI-compatible cloud model.
  * umoja-files: find files by meaning from the overlay.
  * Dock shows running apps and has Ubuntu Dock's right-click menu.
  * Screenshot UI selection can be resized from corners and edges.
  * Greeter runs on Wayland under umoja-mir, with an X11 fallback.
  * Session survives compositor crashes; Lemonade GPU memory is capped.

